fundamentally just believe

00:36:44.001 --> 00:36:45.236
you can just print money?

00:36:45.236 --> 00:36:46.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, we've gotta print.
- Yes.

00:36:46.204 --> 00:36:47.305
Because they've doing it.

00:36:47.305 --> 00:36:48.739
- Yeah, they fundamentally.

00:36:48.739 --> 00:36:50.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's the belief. That's
actually the belief.

00:36:50.308 --> 00:36:51.542
- That's what caused,

00:36:51.542 --> 00:36:53.544
look, Milton Freeman was
my favorite economist.

00:36:53.544 --> 00:36:55.479
He says, "There's
only one entity

00:36:55.479 --> 00:36:56.847
that can create inflation,

00:36:56.847 --> 00:36:59.317
the government when
they spend too much."

00:36:59.317 --> 00:37:02.053 align:start size:97% position:3%
And he also says, "There's
only one way out of inflation,

00:37:02.053 --> 00:37:03.788
is that the interest
rates have to be higher

00:37:03.788 --> 00:37:04.989
than the inflation rate."

00:37:04.989 --> 00:37:06.857
Well, we can't afford that.

00:37:06.857 --> 00:37:09.794 align:start size:88% position:13%
You're gonna be interest
rates over a 6, 7%.

00:37:09.794 --> 00:37:11.028
It's gonna be gone.

00:37:11.028 --> 00:37:12.330
Then I'm worried
about the future.

00:37:12.330 --> 00:37:14.365 align:start size:84% position:16%
I look at these
other four countries

00:37:14.365 --> 00:37:16.434
creating access of power.

00:37:18.402 --> 00:37:21.906 align:start size:97% position:3%
I've watched what a lack of
leadership has happened, okay.

00:37:21.906 --> 00:37:24.442 align:start size:84% position:16%
Think about when the
President got in,

00:37:24.442 --> 00:37:28.646
Afghanistan, creating 13
new Gold Star families.

00:37:28.646 --> 00:37:30.548
So, you know what? We
had a hearing on this.

00:37:30.548 --> 00:37:33.718 align:start size:97% position:3%
For the whole time, they
never went and had a hearing

00:37:33.718 --> 00:37:35.987 align:start size:97% position:3%
because they're afraid of
what they were gonna find out.

00:37:35.987 --> 00:37:37.421 align:start size:84% position:16%
Why would you do
that to our military?

00:37:37.421 --> 00:37:38.889
You wanna never repeat that?

00:37:38.889 --> 00:37:40.625
He didn't listen to
the military leaders.

00:37:40.625 --> 00:37:42.493
He made his own decision.

00:37:42.493 --> 00:37:44.262
We actually had a sniper

00:37:44.262 --> 00:37:47.598
that had the bomber
in his sights, okay.

00:37:50.134 --> 00:37:51.302
But where did that
bomber come from?

00:37:51.302 --> 00:37:53.271
Take it a step back further.

00:37:53.271 --> 00:37:55.239
He was in the prison in Bagram.

00:37:55.239 --> 00:37:56.741
So had he not moved outta Bagram

00:37:56.741 --> 00:37:59.543
where we caught the worst
people for the last decade,

00:37:59.543 --> 00:38:01.445 align:start size:84% position:16%
that person would've
never got out

00:38:01.445 --> 00:38:05.283
and put a bomb on to
kill the Americans.

00:38:05.283 --> 00:38:07.351 align:start size:84% position:16%
And then they wouldn't
look at the system.

00:38:07.351 --> 00:38:09.487
But what happened after that?

00:38:09.487 --> 00:38:11.656
It set us back two decades.

00:38:11.656 --> 00:38:14.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Chancellor of Germany
now goes to China.

00:38:14.525 --> 00:38:17.161
China has now just brokered
a deal in the Middle East

00:38:17.161 --> 00:38:19.263
between Saudi Arabia and Iran.

00:38:19.263 --> 00:38:20.331
That used to be the leadership

00:38:20.331 --> 00:38:23.334
of America at Camp David, right.

00:38:23.334 --> 00:38:24.635
So what he's done is,

00:38:24.635 --> 00:38:27.772 align:start size:84% position:16%
he's lowered the
standards of America

00:38:27.772 --> 00:38:30.107
to our allies and
to our adversaries,

00:38:30.107 --> 00:38:32.109
pushing them further there.

00:38:32.109 --> 00:38:34.979 align:start size:84% position:16%
It also brought
upon Ukraine, right.

00:38:34.979 --> 00:38:37.248 align:start size:84% position:16%
Because then he goes
meets with Putin.

00:38:37.248 --> 00:38:39.150 align:start size:88% position:13%
Putin saw what happened
in Afghanistan.

00:38:39.150 --> 00:38:40.851 align:start size:88% position:13%
And what does he do when
he meets with Putin?

00:38:40.851 --> 00:38:43.621
He lifts the sanctions
off North Stream too.

00:38:43.621 --> 00:38:45.523
He gives 'em a welcome map.

00:38:45.523 --> 00:38:48.893
Back in 2015, I met with
then, Vice President Biden,

00:38:48.893 --> 00:38:53.264 align:start size:97% position:3%
try and encourage him to
sell the Javelins to Ukraine

00:38:53.264 --> 00:38:56.167
so they can stop if any
Russian tanks come in.

00:38:56.167 --> 00:38:57.668 align:start size:84% position:16%
He says, "No, Merkel
won't like that."

00:38:57.668 --> 00:38:59.003 align:start size:84% position:16%
I said, "Well,
let's train them on

00:38:59.003 --> 00:39:00.738
and keep them in Poland
so it's there close."

00:39:00.738 --> 00:39:01.839
"No."

00:39:01.839 --> 00:39:03.074
Remember when he spent too much

00:39:03.074 --> 00:39:05.910 align:start size:88% position:13%
and he told us inflation
was transitory?

00:39:05.910 --> 00:39:07.745
That's the worst punishment

00:39:07.745 --> 00:39:10.281
you can ever do to
your own citizens.

00:39:10.281 --> 00:39:12.216 align:start size:84% position:16%
It takes money
directly out of you.

00:39:12.216 --> 00:39:14.018
And he told us it
was transitory.

00:39:14.018 --> 00:39:16.787
Then the interest rates went
up, then banks got in trouble.

00:39:16.787 --> 00:39:18.556
We're weaker around the world.

00:39:18.556 --> 00:39:21.225
Then he comes out and he
picks one form of energy.

00:39:21.225 --> 00:39:23.094
Makes our energy cost higher.

00:39:23.094 --> 00:39:26.697 align:start size:94% position:6%
Cuts jobs out of America.
It harms emissions.

00:39:26.697 --> 00:39:28.933
Let me tell you this,

00:39:28.933 --> 00:39:32.436
American natural
gas is 41% cleaner

00:39:32.436 --> 00:39:34.538
than Russian natural gas.

00:39:35.840 --> 00:39:38.075
If we sell American natural gas,

00:39:38.075 --> 00:39:41.011 align:start size:88% position:13%
not just to our allies,
to our adversaries,

00:39:41.011 --> 00:39:43.514 align:start size:84% position:16%
global emissions
will go down further

00:39:43.514 --> 00:39:45.616
than any Democrat
bill out there.

00:39:45.616 --> 00:39:47.051
And you know what
else will happen?

00:39:47.051 --> 00:39:49.587
Geopolitically, the
world will be safer.

00:39:49.587 --> 00:39:51.322
They'll be more American jobs.

00:39:51.322 --> 00:39:52.757 align:start size:84% position:16%
You'll have a
better environment,

00:39:52.757 --> 00:39:55.960 align:start position:0%
you'll have a stronger America,
you'll have a safer world.

00:39:55.960 --> 00:39:59.163 align:start size:97% position:3%
And he tells us, "I'm
gonna veto that on demand."

00:39:59.163 --> 00:40:00.931
What? Makes no sense.

00:40:02.099 --> 00:40:03.067 align:start size:81% position:19%
Don't you care
about the country?

00:40:03.067 --> 00:40:05.002
Don't you care about the world?

00:40:05.002 --> 00:40:08.205
And all he does is
empower his IRA bill,

00:40:08.205 --> 00:40:10.408
Inflation Reduction.

00:40:10.408 --> 00:40:12.910
That's a stimulus
bill for China.

00:40:12.910 --> 00:40:14.945
Mandating one form of energy,

00:40:14.945 --> 00:40:16.180
where are you gonna
buy the windmills?

00:40:16.180 --> 00:40:18.082
Where are you gonna
buy the solar panels?

00:40:18.082 --> 00:40:19.316
China.

00:40:19.316 --> 00:40:21.085
And if you watch
what he's done is,

00:40:21.085 --> 00:40:23.421
he's shut down our minerals.

00:40:23.421 --> 00:40:26.957
China controls 90% of
all critical minerals.

00:40:26.957 --> 00:40:29.994
They control 95%
of the processing.

00:40:29.994 --> 00:40:32.396
So when we open up a
new mine in America,

00:40:32.396 --> 00:40:35.132
we gotta send them over
there to be processed.

00:40:35.132 --> 00:40:37.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
One thing we did do, when
we took the majority,

00:40:37.501 --> 00:40:39.170
I've been wanting to
do this for four years,

00:40:39.170 --> 00:40:43.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
I created the select
committee on China, okay.

00:40:43.474 --> 00:40:44.742 align:start size:81% position:19%
The things that
we have failed at,

00:40:44.742 --> 00:40:47.511
we have not spoken with
one voice about China.

00:40:47.511 --> 00:40:49.880
China has systematically,

00:40:49.880 --> 00:40:53.818 align:start position:0%
copper, key, and all these
renewables and everything else,

00:40:53.818 --> 00:40:56.454 align:start size:97% position:3%
back in the 90s, we produced
three times as much.

00:40:56.454 --> 00:40:58.055
They now produce
eight times. Why?

00:40:58.055 --> 00:41:00.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause they've gone around
the world collecting it

00:41:00.391 --> 00:41:02.226
while we shut ours down.

00:41:02.226 --> 00:41:04.428
Why are we empowering them?

00:41:04.428 --> 00:41:07.832
We shouldn't be dependent
upon them on anything.

00:41:07.832 --> 00:41:09.467
We should bring it
back to America,

00:41:09.467 --> 00:41:13.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
and back to just North
and South America as well.

00:41:13.904 --> 00:41:16.273
And what he's done is make
us weaker on that stage.

00:41:16.273 --> 00:41:18.742
And it's only been two years.

00:41:18.742 --> 00:41:21.345
So what keeps me up
is that leadership.

00:41:21.345 --> 00:41:23.013
- Who do you think
is driving that?

00:41:23.013 --> 00:41:24.515
- He is.

00:41:24.515 --> 00:41:27.618
