00:42:27.912 --> 00:42:30.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
And remember, Bernie
Sanders is not a Democrat.

00:42:30.748 --> 00:42:32.249
he's a socialist.

00:42:32.249 --> 00:42:35.352 align:start size:84% position:16%
