and Conservative.

00:45:14.244 --> 00:45:17.981
Don't let the Democrats
take this away, okay.

00:45:17.981 --> 00:45:21.018
The Democrats had a bill
on the floor last Congress

00:45:21.018 --> 00:45:22.586
