00:45:22.586 --> 00:45:24.088 align:start size:88% position:13%
I walked down the floor
and the Republican,

00:45:24.088 --> 00:45:26.356
and I said, "Oh, I'm all for it.

00:45:26.356 --> 00:45:27.691
I think you should
remove more statues

00:45:27.691 --> 00:45:29.560 align:start size:84% position:16%
and I think you should
change your name."

00:45:29.560 --> 00:45:33.697 align:start position:0%
There's not one Republican
statute we ever have to remove.

00:45:33.697 --> 00:45:38.702 align:start size:97% position:3%
The Jim Crow Law was brought
to us by Democrats, okay.

00:45:39.803 --> 00:45:41.071 align:start size:84% position:16%
Think about what
happened in my office.

00:45:41.071 --> 00:45:42.806
You have a portrait
of Abraham Lincoln,

00:45:42.806 --> 00:45:44.942 align:start size:88% position:13%
